# byungmooncho.github.io — FLCC Physics course pages
# Added 2026-09-24 after three Office lock files turned up in PHY151/handouts/.

# ---- Office lock / owner files ------------------------------------------
# Word, Excel and PowerPoint drop these beside a file while it is open.
# They contain the editing user's name, and a stray `git add -A` publishes them.
~$*
*.~lock.*

# ---- Office and OS temporary files --------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.temp
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# ---- Instructor-only material — MUST NEVER reach a public site ----------
# The landing-zone convention keeps answer keys in _Instructor\ locally.
# These patterns are a second line of defence if one is ever copied in.
_Instructor/
*_Key.html
*_Key.pdf

# ---- Local working folders ----------------------------------------------
_to_delete/
Claude outputs/
*.bak
